flowchart TD
    subgraph HostSystem ["Host Backend Environment"]
        HostSecrets["Host Secrets & Environment Variables<br>(OPENAI_API_KEY, GITHUB_TOKEN, DB_CREDENTIALS)"]
        ProductionDB["Production Database / PostgreSQL"]
        ProductionFS["Host Filesystem / Original Repo Directory"]
    end

    subgraph SecurityBoundary ["Sandbox Security Boundary (ADR-007)"]
        PathGuard["WorkspacePathGuard<br>(Rejects ../, symlinks, absolute escapes)"]
        EnvStripper["Environment Stripper & Secret Redactor<br>(Whitelist-only PATH/HOME, strips auth tokens)"]
        ResourceMonitor["Resource Monitor & Quota Limiter<br>(Max 60s timeout, 512MB RAM cap, 100KB output)"]
        CommandAllowlist["Command Runner Allowlist<br>(pytest, python, npm, vitest ONLY; no pip/install)"]
    end

    subgraph IsolatedWorkspace ["Isolated Temporary Workspace (.workspaces/task-xxx)"]
        TargetCopy["Disposable Target Source Copy"]
        GeneratedTest["Proposed Test File"]
        CoverageReportFiles["Coverage Artifacts (.coverage.json)"]
    end

    HostSecrets -.->|BLOCKED by EnvStripper| IsolatedWorkspace
    ProductionDB -.->|BLOCKED by Network Boundary| IsolatedWorkspace
    ProductionFS -.->|BLOCKED by PathGuard & Directory Copy| IsolatedWorkspace
    CommandAllowlist -->|Executes in Workspace CWD| IsolatedWorkspace
    ResourceMonitor -->|Monitors Subprocess| IsolatedWorkspace
    IsolatedWorkspace -->|Safe Removal on Completion| Cleanup["Idempotent Workspace Cleanup"]
